# Traduction IA – à relire
#: wrkspace_chat/tom_2/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Tom"
msgid "So I guess we don't necessarily need you around anymore, but we can't exactly let you go without cause."
msgstr "Donc, on n'a plus vraiment besoin de toi, mais on ne peut pas non plus te virer sans motif."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: wrkspace_chat/tom_2/0/g-1/5
msgctxt "Tom"
msgid "You and I are in something called 'labor limbo'"
